; ColorCensus -- research for docs/research-aga-speed.md: which colour
; indices the terrain (ZOD_MAPCOLORS: the map surface as drawn) and the
; parts of the AGA picture (ZOD_AGA_COLORS: map view, side panel, bottom
; panel) use, on maps of different planets; orig04-style tour so the view
; covers the map. Then tools/amiga/chipprobe once as a functional check
; (FS-UAE's chip timing is not the real machine's).
; LIMIT 1500
; MACHINE aga
FailAt 1000
Wait 5
Echo "=== machine ===" >DEV:Test/auto.log
CPU >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/zod-#?
SetEnv ZOD_AGA_COLORS on
SetEnv ZOD_MAPCOLORS on
SetEnv ZOD_TOUR on
Echo "=== map orig01 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod cc01 20 -o -C pal -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig01.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-cc01.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-cc01.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== map orig08 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod cc08 20 -o -C pal -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig08.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-cc08.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-cc08.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== map orig15 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod cc15 20 -o -C pal -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig15.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-cc15.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-cc15.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== map orig22 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod cc22 20 -o -C pal -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig22.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-cc22.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-cc22.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== map orig29 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Run >NIL: Execute DEV:Test/RunZod cc29 20 -o -C pal -m Data/Campaing/Z_original/p02_bb_orig29.map
Execute DEV:Test/WaitDone DEV:Test/zod-cc29.done
Type DEV:Test/zod-cc29.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
UnSetEnv ZOD_TOUR
UnSetEnv ZOD_MAPCOLORS
UnSetEnv ZOD_AGA_COLORS
Echo "=== chipprobe (functional only) ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
DEV:Test/chipprobe PASSES=4 >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== done ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo >DEV:Test/AutoDone done
